<% content_for :title, 'How It Works & Use Cases — VisionData' %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>How It Works</h1>
    <p class="lead">From discovery to activation in four steps.</p>
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>1) Discover</h3>
        <p>Search and filter leads by firmographics, demographics, technographics, and location. Preview attributes and export samples.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>2) Enrich</h3>
        <p>Upload existing records to append missing data and correct inaccuracies. Configure matching rules and output schemas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>3) Segment</h3>
        <p>Create audience segments using rules and look‑alike models. Score for intent and likelihood to convert.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>4) Activate</h3>
        <p>Sync to CRM/MAP or launch campaigns with deliverability checks, personalization, and attribution tracking.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
  </section>

<section class="section alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Industry Use Cases</h2>
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>B2B SaaS Lead Generation</h3>
        <p>Target ICP by industry, employee range, installed tech, and growth indicators. Route enriched leads to SDRs.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>E‑commerce Segmentation</h3>
        <p>Build personas from purchase patterns and demographics. Personalize lifecycle messaging to increase LTV.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Nonprofit Fundraising</h3>
        <p>Identify high‑affinity donors with wealth and interest signals. Optimize outreach with channel preferences.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Financial Services Compliance</h3>
        <p>Verify and maintain KYC attributes with change detection and audit logs aligned to regulations.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container cta-band-inner">
    <h2>Want a tailored walkthrough?</h2>
    <p>Share your stack and goals—we’ll create a custom demo and test plan.</p>
    <%= link_to 'Talk to a Data Expert', contact_path(anchor: 'talk-to-expert'), class: 'btn' %>
  </div>
</section>

